# Field table: Cboe Titanium U.S. Equities Multicast PITCH (BZX, BYX, EDGX, EDGA),
# with the Sequenced Unit Header, the Gap Request Proxy (GRP) and the Spin Server.
# Source: "Cboe Titanium U.S. Equities/Options Multicast PITCH Specification",
# version 2.41.87, November 10, 2026 (Markdown edition, abbreviated US below).
#
# Offsets. Every PITCH, GRP and Spin message starts with Length (1 byte, counting
# itself) and Message Type (1 byte). The Length is declared as
# "@length_prefix 1 inclusive" and is not a row, so every offset below is the
# specification's offset minus 1, and every @size is the specification's "Total
# Length" minus 1.
#
# Equities layouts only. Where options append fields to a message that equities
# also use (Trade Condition on 0x23, 0x24, 0x2A, 0x2B, 0x30; Client ID and
# Reserved on 0x2F), the equities length is tabled and decode() skips the extra
# options bytes. Options-only messages (0xBC, 0xBD, 0x2E, 0xD2, 0xD1, 0xAD, 0xAE,
# 0xAF, 0x9D, 0x9E) and the options layout of Trading Status (0x31) are not tabled;
# decode() reports them as unknown with the size to skip. See feed.md section 4.
@venue cboe
@endian little
@pad space
@type Binary uint
@type TimeOffset uint
@type BinaryLongPrice uint
@type BinaryShortPrice uint
@type BinaryDate uint
@type BitField uint
@type Alphanumeric char
@type Alpha char
@type PrintableASCII char
@type Opaque bytes

### unit::from_cboe
# Sequenced Unit Header (US, Sequenced Unit Header Message Fields, Table 1). Starts
# every UDP payload and every block on the GRP and Spin TCP streams. HdrLength
# counts the header and the HdrCount messages that follow.
MessageType - 0 0 # SequencedUnitHeader: precedes HdrCount messages (US, Sequenced Unit Header Message Fields, Table 1)
@size 8
HdrLength Binary 0 2 # Length of the header and the HdrCount messages that follow
HdrCount Binary 2 1 # Number of messages after this header; 0 is a heartbeat
HdrUnit Binary 3 1 # Unit of the messages; 0 when unsequenced
HdrSequence Binary 4 4 # Sequence of the first message; 0 when unsequenced; rolls from 4294967295 to 1

### unit::to_cboe
# The same header, sent by the client before each GRP or Spin message, with
# HdrUnit and HdrSequence 0 (US, Gap Request Proxy Messages; Spin Messages).
MessageType - 0 0 # SequencedUnitHeader: unsequenced header for client messages (US, Sequenced Unit Header Message Fields, Table 1)
@size 8
HdrLength Binary 0 2 # Length of the header and the HdrCount messages that follow
HdrCount Binary 2 1 # Number of messages after this header
HdrUnit Binary 3 1 # 0 (unsequenced)
HdrSequence Binary 4 4 # 0 (unsequenced)

### pitch::from_cboe
@length_prefix 1 inclusive
@type_code uint 1

MessageType 0xB1 0 1 # TimeReference: midnight reference and trade date; BZX and EDGX equities only (US, Time Reference Message Fields, Table 1; spec 18 bytes)
@size 17
MidnightReference Binary 1 4 # Midnight Eastern Time, whole seconds since 1970-01-01 UTC
Time Binary 5 4 # Whole seconds since the start of the Eastern Time calendar day (wall clock)
TimeOffset TimeOffset 9 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
TradeDate BinaryDate 13 4 # YYYYMMDD as a binary integer

MessageType 0x20 0 1 # TimeMessage: new base second for the unit's time offsets (US, Time Message Fields, Table 1; spec 6 bytes, 10 on BZX and EDGX equities)
Time Binary 1 4 # Whole seconds since the start of the Eastern Time calendar day (wall clock)
EpochTime Opaque 5 # BZX and EDGX equities only: 4 bytes, uint32 little endian, whole seconds since 1970-01-01 UTC; absent (tail_len 0) on BYX and EDGA

MessageType 0x97 0 1 # UnitClear: clear every order of the unit in the header (US, Unit Clear Message Fields, Table 1; spec 6 bytes)
@size 5
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp

MessageType 0x21 0 1 # AddOrderLong: a visible order added to the book (US, Add Order Message Fields, Table 1; spec 34 bytes)
@size 33
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Day-specific order identifier
SideIndicator Alphanumeric 13 1 # B buy, S sell
Quantity Binary 14 4 # Shares added (may be less than entered)
Symbol PrintableASCII 18 6 # Right padded with spaces
Price BinaryLongPrice 24 8 # 4 implied decimals
AddFlags BitField 32 1 # Bit 0 reserved, set to 1; bit 3 AON (options only); others reserved

MessageType 0x22 0 1 # AddOrderShort: a visible order added, short form (US, Add Order Message Fields, Table 2; spec 26 bytes)
@size 25
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Day-specific order identifier
SideIndicator Alphanumeric 13 1 # B buy, S sell
Quantity Binary 14 2 # Shares added (may be less than entered)
Symbol PrintableASCII 16 6 # Right padded with spaces
Price BinaryShortPrice 22 2 # 2 implied decimals
AddFlags BitField 24 1 # Bit 0 reserved, set to 1; bit 3 AON (options only); others reserved

MessageType 0x2F 0 1 # AddOrderExpanded: a visible order added, 8-character symbol and attribution (US, Add Order Message Fields, Table 3; spec 41 bytes equities, 50 options)
@size 40
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Day-specific order identifier
SideIndicator Alphanumeric 13 1 # B buy, S sell
Quantity Binary 14 4 # Shares added (may be less than entered)
Symbol PrintableASCII 18 8 # Right padded with spaces
Price BinaryLongPrice 26 8 # 4 implied decimals
AddFlags BitField 34 1 # Bit 0 reserved, set to 1; bit 3 AON (options only); others reserved
ParticipantID Alphanumeric 35 4 # MPID, or RTAL for retail orders; spaces when not attributed
CustomerIndicator Alphanumeric 39 1 # R retail priority (EDGX equities only); space on other equities markets

MessageType 0x23 0 1 # OrderExecuted: a visible order executed at its booked price (US, Order Executed Message Fields, Table 1; spec 26 bytes equities, 27 options)
@size 25
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Order executed
ExecutedQuantity Binary 13 4 # Shares executed
ExecutionId Binary 17 8 # Day-unique execution identifier, referenced by Trade Break

MessageType 0x24 0 1 # OrderExecutedAtPriceSize: a visible order executed at another price, or beyond its displayed size (US, Order Executed at Price/Size, Table 1; spec 38 bytes equities, 39 options)
@size 37
TimeOffset Binary 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp (typed Binary in the spec)
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Order executed
ExecutedQuantity Binary 13 4 # Shares executed
RemainingQuantity Binary 17 4 # Shares left on the book; 0 removes the order
ExecutionId Binary 21 8 # Day-unique execution identifier, referenced by Trade Break
Price BinaryLongPrice 29 8 # Execution price, 4 implied decimals

MessageType 0x25 0 1 # ReduceSizeLong: part of a visible order cancelled (US, Reduce Size Message Fields, Table 1; spec 18 bytes)
@size 17
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Order reduced
CanceledQuantity Binary 13 4 # Shares cancelled

MessageType 0x26 0 1 # ReduceSizeShort: part of a visible order cancelled, short form (US, Reduce Size Message Fields, Table 2; spec 16 bytes)
@size 15
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Order reduced
CanceledQuantity Binary 13 2 # Shares cancelled

MessageType 0x27 0 1 # ModifyOrderLong: new size and price of a visible order (US, Modify Order Message Fields, Table 1; spec 27 bytes)
@size 26
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Order modified
Quantity Binary 13 4 # Shares after this modify
Price BinaryLongPrice 17 8 # Limit price after this modify, 4 implied decimals
ModifyFlags BitField 25 1 # Bit 0 display (aggregated in the Cboe SIP quote); bit 1 maintain priority (0 reset, 1 maintain)

MessageType 0x28 0 1 # ModifyOrderShort: new size and price of a visible order, short form (US, Modify Order Message Fields, Table 2; spec 19 bytes)
@size 18
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Order modified
Quantity Binary 13 2 # Shares after this modify
Price BinaryShortPrice 15 2 # Limit price after this modify, 2 implied decimals
ModifyFlags BitField 17 1 # Bit 0 display (aggregated in the Cboe SIP quote); bit 1 maintain priority (0 reset, 1 maintain)

MessageType 0x29 0 1 # DeleteOrder: a visible order removed from the book (US, Delete Order Message Fields, Table 1; spec 14 bytes)
@size 13
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Order removed; the same id may be added again later

MessageType 0x2A 0 1 # TradeLong: execution of a non-displayed or routed order; does not change the book (US, Trade Message Fields, Table 1; spec 41 bytes equities, 42 options)
@size 40
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Obfuscated order id by default
SideIndicator Alphanumeric 13 1 # Always B, whatever the resting side
Quantity Binary 14 4 # Shares executed
Symbol PrintableASCII 18 6 # Right padded with spaces
Price BinaryLongPrice 24 8 # Execution price, 4 implied decimals
ExecutionId Binary 32 8 # Day-unique execution identifier, referenced by Trade Break

MessageType 0x2B 0 1 # TradeShort: execution of a non-displayed or routed order, short form (US, Trade Message Fields, Table 2; spec 33 bytes equities, 34 options)
@size 32
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Obfuscated order id by default
SideIndicator Alphanumeric 13 1 # Always B, whatever the resting side
Quantity Binary 14 2 # Shares executed
Symbol PrintableASCII 16 6 # Right padded with spaces
Price BinaryShortPrice 22 2 # Execution price, 2 implied decimals
ExecutionId Binary 24 8 # Day-unique execution identifier, referenced by Trade Break

MessageType 0x30 0 1 # TradeExpanded: execution of a non-displayed or routed order, 8-character symbol (US, Trade Message Fields, Table 3; spec 43 bytes equities, 44 options)
@size 42
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
OrderId Binary 5 8 # Obfuscated order id by default
SideIndicator Alphanumeric 13 1 # Always B, whatever the resting side
Quantity Binary 14 4 # Shares executed
Symbol PrintableASCII 18 8 # Right padded with spaces
Price BinaryLongPrice 26 8 # Execution price, 4 implied decimals
ExecutionId Binary 34 8 # Day-unique execution identifier, referenced by Trade Break

MessageType 0x2C 0 1 # TradeBreak: an earlier execution broken (US, Trade Break Message Fields, Table 1; spec 14 bytes)
@size 13
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
ExecutionId Binary 5 8 # Execution Id of an earlier Order Executed or Trade message

MessageType 0x2D 0 1 # EndOfSession: the unit shuts down; no more sequenced messages (US, End of Session Message Fields, Table 1; spec 6 bytes)
@size 5
Timestamp Binary 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp (named Timestamp in the spec)

MessageType 0x31 0 1 # TradingStatusMessage: trading status of a symbol, equities layout (US, Trading Status Message Fields, Table 1; spec 18 bytes)
@size 17
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
Symbol PrintableASCII 5 8 # Right padded with spaces
TradingStatus Alpha 13 1 # A accepting orders for queuing, H halted, Q quote-only, S suspension, T trading; E, L, O, P effective 02/01/27
RegSHOAction Alphanumeric 14 1 # 0 no price test, 1 Reg SHO price test in effect
Reserved1 Alpha 15 1 # Reserved
Reserved2 Alpha 16 1 # Reserved

MessageType 0x95 0 1 # AuctionUpdate: auction price and size; BZX and BYX equities only (US, Auction Update Message Fields, Tables 1 and 2; spec 47 bytes)
@size 46
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
StockSymbol PrintableASCII 5 8 # Right padded with spaces
AuctionType Alphanumeric 13 1 # O opening, C closing, H halt, I IPO, M Cboe Market Close (BZX); P periodic (BYX)
ReferencePrice Binary 14 8 # Collared auction price; spec type Binary, examples use 4 implied decimals
BuyShares Binary 22 4 # Buy shares at the reference price; matched shares for CMC
SellShares Binary 26 4 # Sell shares at the reference price; matched shares for CMC
IndicativePrice Binary 30 8 # Auction and continuous books match here; 0 on BYX; spec type Binary
AuctionOnlyPrice Binary 38 8 # Auction book alone matches here; 0 on BYX; spec type Binary

MessageType 0x96 0 1 # AuctionSummary: auction result; BYX and BZX equities and options (US, Auction Summary Message Fields, Table 1; spec 27 bytes)
@size 26
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
StockSymbol PrintableASCII 5 8 # Right padded with spaces
AuctionType Alphanumeric 13 1 # C closing, H halt, I IPO, M Cboe Market Close, P periodic (BYX); O, G, V options
Price BinaryLongPrice 14 8 # Auction or CMC price, 4 implied decimals
Shares Binary 22 4 # Shares executed in the auction (Shares/Contracts in the spec)

MessageType 0x98 0 1 # RetailPriceImprovementMessage: retail liquidity indicator; BYX and EDGX only (US, Retail Price Improvement Message Fields, Table 1; spec 15 bytes)
@size 14
TimeOffset TimeOffset 1 4 # Nanoseconds since the last unit timestamp
Symbol PrintableASCII 5 8 # Right padded with spaces
RetailPriceImprovement Alpha 13 1 # B buy side, S sell side, A both, N none

### grp::to_cboe
# Client to Gap Request Proxy, TCP, each message after an unsequenced unit header
# (US, Gap Request Proxy Messages).
@length_prefix 1 inclusive
@type_code uint 1

MessageType 0x01 0 1 # Login: first message on the connection (US, Login Message Fields, Table 1; spec 22 bytes)
@size 21
SessionSubId Alphanumeric 1 4 # Supplied by Cboe
Username Alphanumeric 5 4 # Supplied by Cboe
Filler Alphanumeric 9 2 # Spaces
Password Alphanumeric 11 10 # Supplied by Cboe

MessageType 0x03 0 1 # GapRequest: request retransmission of a sequence range (US, Gap Request Message Fields, Table 1; spec 9 bytes)
@size 8
Unit Binary 1 1 # Unit of the gap
Sequence Binary 2 4 # First (lowest) sequence of the range
Count Binary 6 2 # Number of messages; at most 100 (US, Limitations/Configurations - Production)

### grp::from_cboe
@length_prefix 1 inclusive
@type_code uint 1

MessageType 0x02 0 1 # LoginResponse: login accepted or refused (US, Login Response Message Fields, Table 1; spec 3 bytes)
@size 2
Status Alphanumeric 1 1 # A accepted, N not authorized, B session in use, S invalid session

MessageType 0x04 0 1 # GapResponse: one per Gap Request (US, Gap Response Message Fields, Table 1; spec 10 bytes)
@size 9
Unit Binary 1 1 # Unit from the request
Sequence Binary 2 4 # Sequence from the request
Count Binary 6 2 # Count from the request
Status Alphanumeric 8 1 # A accepted; O out of range, D daily, M minute, S second limit, C count limit, I invalid unit, U unit unavailable

### spin::to_cboe
# Client to Spin Server, TCP, each message after an unsequenced unit header
# (US, Spin Messages).
@length_prefix 1 inclusive
@type_code uint 1

MessageType 0x01 0 1 # Login: same layout as the GRP Login (US, Spin Messages, Login)
@size 21
SessionSubId Alphanumeric 1 4 # Supplied by Cboe
Username Alphanumeric 5 4 # Supplied by Cboe
Filler Alphanumeric 9 2 # Spaces
Password Alphanumeric 11 10 # Supplied by Cboe

MessageType 0x81 0 1 # SpinRequest: request the book up to a sequence (US, Spin Request Message Fields, Table 1; spec 6 bytes)
@size 5
Sequence Binary 1 4 # From one of the last ten Spin Image Available messages

MessageType 0x84 0 1 # InstrumentDefinitionRequest: request a spin of Symbol Mapping messages; options use (US, Instrument Definition Request Message Fields, Table 1; spec 6 bytes)
@size 5
Sequence Binary 1 4 # Must be 0

### spin::from_cboe
# Spin Server to client. The spin itself (Time, Add Order, Trading Status, Auction
# Update, Retail Price Improvement) arrives on the same stream as pitch::from_cboe
# messages; their type codes do not overlap with these.
@length_prefix 1 inclusive
@type_code uint 1

MessageType 0x02 0 1 # LoginResponse: same layout as the GRP Login Response (US, Spin Messages, Login Response)
@size 2
Status Alphanumeric 1 1 # A accepted, N not authorized, B session in use, S invalid session

MessageType 0x80 0 1 # SpinImageAvailable: a spin is available through this sequence; about once a second (US, Spin Image Available Message Fields, Table 1; spec 6 bytes)
@size 5
Sequence Binary 1 4 # Last sequence applied to the spin image

MessageType 0x82 0 1 # SpinResponse: whether the spin will be sent (US, Spin Response Message Fields, Table 1; spec 11 bytes)
@size 10
Sequence Binary 1 4 # Sequence from the Spin Request
OrderCount Binary 5 4 # Number of Add Order messages in the spin
Status Alphanumeric 9 1 # A accepted, O out of range, S spin already in progress

MessageType 0x83 0 1 # SpinFinished: all messages of the spin sent (US, Spin Finished Message Fields, Table 1; spec 6 bytes)
@size 5
Sequence Binary 1 4 # Sequence from the Spin Request

MessageType 0x85 0 1 # InstrumentDefinitionResponse: whether the instrument spin will be sent; options use (US, Instrument Definition Response Message Fields, Table 1; spec 11 bytes)
@size 10
Sequence Binary 1 4 # Always 0
InstrumentCount Binary 5 4 # Number of Symbol Mapping and Complex Instrument Definition messages
Status Alphanumeric 9 1 # A accepted, O out of range, S spin already in progress

MessageType 0x86 0 1 # InstrumentDefinitionFinished: instrument spin complete; options use (US, Instrument Definition Finished Message Fields, Table 1; spec 2 bytes)
@size 1

### end
